# Systems Override: "If it's a Spacecraft, put ten charge counters on it. If you do, remove ten charge counters from it at the beginning of the next end step."
# Under Solemnity ("Players can't get counters. Counters can't be put on artifacts, creatures, enchantments, or lands.") the counters can't be put, so "if you do"
# is false and nothing is removed later. Bot2 stations Specimen Freighter once with Memnite (one charge counter) before Solemnity exists. On turn 3
# Bot1 casts Solemnity, then takes the Freighter: control, untap and haste still happen, no counters are added (it stays at one, no creature), and at the end
# step the one counter it had is still there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Solemnity
Systems Override
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Specimen Freighter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
